    "entry": "酒盗",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "しゅとう",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "dish of pickled skipjack tuna entrails sometimes mixed with sake, honey, mirin and onions (specialty of Kochi Prefecture)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "高知の居酒屋で、熱燗のつまみにカツオの酒盗を頼んだら、あまりの旨さに酒が止まらなくなった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「酒盗を少しクリームチーズに乗せて食べると、ワインの最高のお供になるんだよ」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "この店の酒盗は自家製で、内臓のコクと塩気のバランスが絶妙な逸品だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3-flash-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "同じ地方でまた酒盗などというのも同じ物らしく、これは商人の広告用命名で、現在はその類の珍らしい名が多い。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "食料名彙",
                "author": "柳田國男",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
